This licence covers the installer's own source code only.

DLSS5Kit bundles no third-party binaries. Every component it installs is
downloaded at run time from its own publisher and remains under its own
licence: ReShade (BSD-3-Clause), crosire/reshade-shaders (per file),
DLSS5-Feeder, LumeniteFX (AGNYA), dlss5-bridge.

The DLSS 5 neural rendering add-on (renodx-dlss5.addon64) and the NVIDIA NGX
runtimes (nvngx_dlssnr.dll, nvngx_dlss.dll) are closed-source software with no
published licence. They are NOT in this repository, NOT in any release
archive, and NOT redistributed by this project. The tool downloads them from a
public community mirror, exactly as a person would by hand.

Nothing here is affiliated with or endorsed by NVIDIA, ReShade or RenoDX.
